================================================================================
Build-time dependencies — NOT bundled
================================================================================

The following tools are used during the build process but are NOT included in
the distribution archives:

  APT packages (Linux build environment only):
    cuda-keyring, cuda-nvcc, and other development packages installed via APT
    are used to set up the build environment. Only the specific files listed
    above are extracted and bundled; the packages themselves are not shipped.

  7-Zip (Windows build only):
    Used to create the .7z archive. Not bundled.
    https://www.7-zip.org/  (LGPL / unRAR license)

  winget (Windows build only):
    Used to install the CUDA Toolkit on the build runner. Not bundled.

  GitHub Actions tooling (CI/CD only):
    actions/checkout, aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials, and
    Cyberboss/install-winget are used in CI/CD pipelines only. Not bundled.
